          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Connect • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1113; --card:#0f1316; --accent:#f5c28b; --muted:#9aa1a6; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\\n      --max:1100px;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071014 0%,#0b0f12 100%);color:#e9eef0;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:36px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.06em}\\n    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .navlinks a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:12px}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.08em}\\n    .h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.02;margin:8px 0 12px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;max-width:54ch}\\n    .hero-visual{position:relative;background:var(--glass);border-radius:10px;padding:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),rgba(255,255,255,0.00));padding:20px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .mini{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#ffefd6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#102026;font-weight:700}\\n    .kicker{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* diagnostic */\\n    .section{margin-top:36px}\\n    .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:24px}\\n    .diagnostic .questions{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .question{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .question:last-child{border-bottom:none}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* plan */\\n    .plans{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .plan{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .plan h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}\\n    .micro{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .habit{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);padding:12px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .price{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffd9b8);color:#081014;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);border:none;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;color:#081014;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px}\\n    form.contact{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:inherit}\\n    footer{margin-top:48px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding-top:18px}\\n    a.cta-link{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.plans{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class='brand'>\\n        <div class='mini'>\\n          <div class='avatar'>{{COACH_NAME|slice:0:1}}</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n            <div class='kicker'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='navlinks'>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='programs.html'>Paths</a>\\n        <a href='services.html'>Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class='eyebrow'>Invitation from {{COACH_NAME}}</div>\\n        <h2 class='h1'>A quiet strategy to steady your days and deepen vitality</h2>\\n        <p class='lead'>I blend ritual, simple habit architecture, and soulful accountability. No spectacle — just steady change. If you want measurable calm, clearer energy rhythms, and tools that honor your life, we begin here.</p>\\n\\n        <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;align-items:center'>\\n          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class='ghost' href='book.html'>Book a clarity call</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style='margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted)'>\\n          <div class='pill'>Coach • {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n          <div class='pill'>Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          <div class='pill'><a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:none'>Call</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='hero-visual'>\\n        <div class='card' style='width:100%'>\\n          <!-- local svg placeholder -->\\n          <img src='assets/img/hero.svg' alt='illustration' style='width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px'>\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Personal note</div>\\n              <div style='font-weight:700'>Start with a simple 2-week rhythm</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style='text-align:right'>\\n              <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Free guide</div>\\n              <div class='pill'>Daily cue bundle</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Brief diagnostic snapshot -->\\n    <section class='section diagnostic'>\\n      <div class='grid2'>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Well-Being Snapshot</h3>\\n          <p class='kicker'>A two-minute journal to clarify where support will help most</p>\\n          <div class='questions'>\\n            <div class='question'>1. How often do you wake feeling rested? <span class='pill'>Daily / 3-4x week / Rarely</span></div>\\n            <div class='question'>2. Energy mid-afternoon? <span class='pill'>Stable / Dips / Crash</span></div>\\n            <div class='question'>3. Stress recovery time? <span class='pill'>Quick / Moderate / Long</span></div>\\n            <div class='question'>4. Small habits you already keep? <span class='pill'>Movement / Sleep routine / Breathing</span></div>\\n            <div class='question'>5. Biggest barrier to change? <span class='pill'>Time / Overwhelm / Motivation</span></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:12px'>\\n            <a class='btn' href='programs.html'>Explore tailored paths</a>\\n            <a class='ghost' href='about.html'>My approach</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside style='background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin-top:0'>Quick takeaway</h4>\\n          <p class='kicker'>The diagnostic points to two levers: daily cues and a weekly ritual to anchor progress. My short frameworks focus on both.</p>\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px'>\\n            <div class='price'>Free guide</div>\\n            <div class='pill'>5-day reset</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Plan overview -->\\n    <section class='section'>\\n      <h3 style='margin-bottom:6px'>Ways to begin</h3>\\n      <p class='kicker'>Three compassionate structures, each built around predictable micro-habits and weekly reflection.</p>\\n      <div class='plans'>\\n        <div class='plan'>\\n          <h3>Foundation Rituals</h3>\\n          <div class='kicker'>Short bespoke routines to steady sleep and mood</div>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>2 core evening cues</li>\\n            <li>Daily 8-minute awareness practice</li>\\n            <li>Weekly 20-minute reflection</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'>\\n            <div class='price'>$49 / week</div>\\n            <a class='ghost' href='pricing.html'>Detail</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='plan'>\\n          <h3>Momentum Cocoon</h3>\\n          <div class='kicker'>For steady progress with guided accountability</div>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Personal habit map</li>\\n            <li>Two live check-ins per month</li>\\n            <li>Access to cohort resources</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'>\\n            <div class='price'>$199 / month</div>\\n            <a class='ghost' href='programs.html'>Learn more</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='plan'>\\n          <h3>Guided Cohort</h3>\\n          <div class='kicker'>Seasonal group program with workshops and practice sprints</div>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>8-week course with live sessions</li>\\n            <li>Daily micro-practices</li>\\n            <li>Community check-ins</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'>\\n            <div class='price'>$699 cohort</div>\\n            <a class='ghost' href='programs.html'>Apply</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Micro habits -->\\n    <section class='section micro_habits'>\\n      <h3 style='margin-bottom:6px'>Micro-habits you can start today</h3>\\n      <p class='kicker'>Tiny practices that compound. Pick two and commit for 14 days.</p>\\n      <div class='micro'>\\n        <label class='habit'><input type='checkbox' aria-label='habit-1'> One-minute morning check-in: notice one intention for the day.</label>\\n        <label class='habit'><input type='checkbox' aria-label='habit-2'> 8-minute movement or breath at mid-day to reset energy.</label>\\n        <label class='habit'><input type='checkbox' aria-label='habit-3'> An evening quieting ritual: dim lights, one gratitude, deep exhale.</label>\\n        <label class='habit'><input type='checkbox' aria-label='habit-4'> Micro-boundary: 20-minute screen-free window before bed.</label>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Pricing teaser + CTA -->\\n    <section class='section'>\\n      <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap'>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 6px'>Investment & next steps</h3>\\n          <p class='kicker'>I price for connection and outcomes. Choose a rhythm, then we refine your daily map.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n          <a class='btn' href='pricing.html'>See full pricing</a>\\n          <a class='ghost' href='book.html'>Schedule a free consult</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Primary contact form CTA -->\\n    <section class='section'>\\n      <h3>Reach out</h3>\\n      <p class='kicker'>Tell me briefly about your main aim and preferred way to connect. I read every message.</p>\\n      <div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;margin-top:12px'>\\n        <form class='card contact' action='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' method='post' enctype='text/plain'>\\n          <input name='name' placeholder='Your name' required>\\n          <input name='email' placeholder='Your email' required>\\n          <select name='interest'>\\n            <option>Foundation Rituals</option>\\n            <option>Momentum Cocoon</option>\\n            <option>Guided Cohort</option>\\n            <option>Free guide</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <textarea name='message' rows='5' placeholder='A short note about your priorities'></textarea>\\n          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'>\\n            <button class='btn' type='submit'>Send message</button>\\n            <a class='ghost' href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>Call { {PHONE}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <aside class='card'>\\n          <img src='assets/img/avatar.svg' alt='coach avatar' style='width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:12px 0 6px'>Personal note from {{COACH_NAME}}</h4>\\n          <p class='kicker'>I prioritize listening. In our first conversation we clarify a small, visible next step you can use right away.</p>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n            <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Email</div>\\n            <div><a class='cta-link' href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            <div style='margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Phone</div>\\n            <div><a class='cta-link' href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:14px'>\\n            <img src='assets/img/pattern.svg' alt='pattern' style='width:100%;opacity:0.6'>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap'>\\n        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{TAGLINE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n          <a href='privacy.html' style='color:var(--muted)'>Privacy</a>\\n          <a href='terms.html' style='color:var(--muted)'>Terms</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Project chunk: contact + documentation\\n\\nPurpose:\\nThis chunk contains the contact page template (contact.html) and this README. The design follows the 'aura_editorial' layout family: bold typography, high-contrast palette, editorial spacing, and intentional CTAs.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html  (primary contact page with hero, diagnostic snapshot, plan outline, micro_habits, pricing teaser, and CTA form)\\n\\nPlaceholders used (replace at build/runtime):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- This page intentionally echoes the required section pack (hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, cta) so the page set feels cohesive when linked from index.html and other pages.\\n- The nav labels differ slightly from other templates (Home, Paths, Work With Me, Connect) to satisfy uniqueness across templates.\\n- The contact form uses a simple mailto action for portability. Replace with your form endpoint or client-side handler as needed.\\n\\nAssets expected elsewhere in the project (local SVGs):\\n- assets/img/hero.svg\\n- assets/img/avatar.svg\\n- assets/img/pattern.svg\\n\\nThese SVGs are referenced from contact.html; they must be provided in the assets/img folder in the final build. Each page template in the full project should have unique SVGs (no copying) to preserve visual uniqueness.\\n\\nContent guidance:\\n- Voice is 'spiritual_teacher' — warm, grounded, purposeful language. Copy avoids medical claims and focuses on habits, frameworks, and outcomes.\\n- Program names are distinct here: Foundation Rituals, Momentum Cocoon, Guided Cohort.\\n- CTA buttons reference the primary CTA placeholder: {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- Layout is responsive with a single-column fallback under 880px.\\n- Form fields are labeled and inputs follow a simple visual contrast.\\n\\nHow to localize or customize:\\n- Replace placeholders in your build process or via a templating engine.\\n- Swap the mailto form action for an API endpoint for production use.\\n- Provide local SVG files with the expected names and sizes to match the editorial layout.\\n\\nLicensing and assets:\\n- No external fonts, CDNs, or analytics are referenced in this chunk. All visuals should be local assets.\\n\\nIf this chunk is combined into a larger site, ensure other pages vary heading phrasing, program names, and FAQ wording to meet uniqueness constraints.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
